=====Usage notes=====
* Becomes {{m|gd|dh'}} before a word beginning with a vowel or a lenited '''fh''' followed by a vowel.
*: {{ux|inline=1|gd|'''Dh''''fhàg an t-òran brònach mi.|The song made me sad.}}
